"calibration.result_body": "Accept it, try again, or adjust it by hand in Settings.",
"calibration.accept": "ACCEPT",
"calibration.retry": "TRY AGAIN",
"speaker.darto": "DARTO",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.land.1": "Nothing personal, fisherman. Business is business.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.land.2": "We can do this politely. With violence.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.land.3": "You again? Fine. Keep your hands up.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.land.4": "I had plans this afternoon. Now I have to punch you.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.player_win.1": "Fair. The bucket earned me.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.player_win.2": "Good hit. Don't make this weird.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.player_win.3": "Tell the market I went down professionally.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.player_win.4": "I respect the hustle. I do not respect the bucket.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.fish_win.1": "Tell the bucket I said no.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.fish_win.2": "Good effort. Terrible outcome.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.fish_win.3": "Nothing personal. I prefer the lake.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.fish_win.4": "Come back when your footwork stops apologizing.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.reel_escape.1": "Too much tension, fisherman!",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.reel_escape.2": "Your line resigned before I did.",
"dialogue.catfish_bruiser.reel_escape.3": "We'll call that a warning.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.land.1": "Warm-up set complete. Now we duel.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.land.2": "I counted your pulls. Disappointing volume.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.land.3": "Excellent. Resistance training delivered itself.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.land.4": "Fisherman! Hydrate. Then prepare to lose.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.player_win.1": "Solid technique. Questionable lifestyle.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.player_win.2": "That counter had good form. Respect.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.player_win.3": "Fine. Today was apparently leg day.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.player_win.4": "The bucket better have protein.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.fish_win.1": "RECOVERY DAY!",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.fish_win.2": "Your technique collapsed before my gains did.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.fish_win.3": "Train harder. Reel cleaner.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.fish_win.4": "I will log this as cardio.",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.reel_escape.1": "Grip strength! Work on it!",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.reel_escape.2": "The line failed its set!",
"dialogue.tilapia_gym_rat.reel_escape.3": "Progressive overload, fisherman! Not catastrophic overload!",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.land.1": "This meeting was not scheduled.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.land.2": "We can settle this without paperwork.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.land.3": "I have associates in deeper water.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.land.4": "Whatever happens next, you did not hear my name.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.player_win.1": "Unfortunate. Delete the records.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.player_win.2": "The bucket and I have never met.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.player_win.3": "I want it noted that this transaction is disputed.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.player_win.4": "Fine. But I was never here.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.fish_win.1": "No witnesses. Perfect.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.fish_win.2": "Our business is concluded.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.fish_win.3": "You should forget my face.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.fish_win.4": "The lake has excellent legal representation.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.reel_escape.1": "Evidence destroyed.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.reel_escape.2": "Loose line. Loose ends. Same principle.",
"dialogue.gourami_shady.reel_escape.3": "You cannot prove that was me.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.land.1": "You may admire me briefly before losing.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.land.2": "Do not wrinkle the scales.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.land.3": "I was having a premium afternoon.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.land.4": "The audacity of that fishing line.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.player_win.1": "This is economically humiliating.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.player_win.2": "Put something soft in the bucket.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.player_win.3": "I expect premium transportation.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.player_win.4": "You won. Your wardrobe remains concerning.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.fish_win.1": "As expected. Luxury returns to the water.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.fish_win.2": "Your net worth and your win rate remain consistent.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.fish_win.3": "Do wave when I pass your motorcycle.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.fish_win.4": "Some things simply cannot be afforded.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.reel_escape.1": "Cheap line. Predictable.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.reel_escape.2": "That was not premium tension management.",
"dialogue.carp_golden.reel_escape.3": "Consider equipment with dignity.",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.land.1": "POSTURE! EYES FORWARD! PREPARE!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.land.2": "YOU CALL THAT A LANDING? AGAIN!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.land.3": "DISCIPLINE BEGINS WHERE COMFORT ENDS!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.land.4": "YOU HAVE ENTERED COMBAT WATER!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.player_win.1": "ACCEPTABLE PERFORMANCE! BARELY!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.player_win.2": "DEFEAT ACKNOWLEDGED! CARRY ON!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.player_win.3": "GOOD COUNTER! TERRIBLE SANDALS!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.player_win.4": "THE BUCKET IS NOW MY ASSIGNED POST!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.fish_win.1": "RETURN TO TRAINING!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.fish_win.2": "MISSION FAILED, FISHERMAN!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.fish_win.3": "THE LAKE RETAINS THIS POSITION!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.fish_win.4": "DISCIPLINE: MINE. DINNER: NOT YOURS.",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.reel_escape.1": "LINE INTEGRITY FAILURE!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.reel_escape.2": "TENSION MANAGEMENT: UNSATISFACTORY!",
"dialogue.snakehead_sergeant.reel_escape.3": "REGROUP AND CAST AGAIN!",
"dialogue.arowana_don.land.1": "We meet again. The lake has a sense of humor.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.land.2": "Patience brought you here. Let us see what skill does.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.land.3": "You have become persistent. I respect persistence.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.land.4": "Do not mistake rarity for luck, Darto.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.player_win.1": "A clean victory. Do not become arrogant.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.player_win.2": "You have improved. Quietly. That is preferable.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.player_win.3": "Take your money. The lake will survive the insult.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.player_win.4": "Consistency is an irritating quality. Keep it.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.fish_win.1": "Not today, Darto.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.fish_win.2": "You were close. Close is still underwater.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.fish_win.3": "The lake keeps what you cannot finish.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.fish_win.4": "Return when your patience is heavier than your regret.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.reel_escape.1": "You pulled too hard. Life has taught you nothing?",
"dialogue.arowana_don.reel_escape.2": "Patience, Darto. Even a line knows its limit.",
"dialogue.arowana_don.reel_escape.3": "The lake remains undefeated by impatience.",
"dialogue.darto.after_win.1": "Into the bucket. Please don't make this personal.",
"dialogue.darto.after_win.2": "I can't believe this counts as work now.",
"dialogue.darto.after_win.3": "Good. Bu Yati is going to ask questions again.",
"dialogue.darto.after_win.4": "One fish closer. That's enough.",
"dialogue.darto.after_loss.1": "Of course it can fight. Of course it can win.",
"dialogue.darto.after_loss.2": "Nobody at home needs to know that happened.",
"dialogue.darto.after_loss.3": "Fine. Next one.",
"dialogue.darto.after_loss.4": "I came here to relax. Important mistake.",
"dialogue.darto.after_reel_escape.1": "Too hard. My fault.",
"dialogue.darto.after_reel_escape.2": "Easy, Darto. It's a fish, not a debt collector.",
"dialogue.darto.after_reel_escape.3": "That line had a shorter career than I expected.",
"dialogue.advance": "TAP TO CONTINUE",
"wheel.title": "WHEEL OF FATE",
"wheel.skip_hold": "HOLD TO SKIP",
"wheel.result": "{duel}!",
"duel.boxing.upper": "BOXING",
"duel.arm_wrestle.upper": "ARM WRESTLING",
"duel.dance.upper": "DANCE",
"duel.suwit.upper": "SUWIT",
"suwit.move.rock": "ROCK",
"suwit.move.scissors": "SCISSORS",
"suwit.move.paper": "PAPER",
"suwit.charm": "CHARM ({count})",
"suwit.charm_none": "NO CHARM",
"suwit.tell": "THE FISH IS SHOWING...",
"suwit.real_move": "REAL MOVE: {move}",
"suwit.panic_pick": "PANIC PICK!",
"suwit.outcome.win": "YOU TAKE THE ROUND",
"suwit.outcome.loss": "THE FISH TAKES THE ROUND",
"suwit.outcome.draw": "DRAW. AGAIN.",
"suwit.intro.subtitle": "SUWIT. FIRST TO TWO.",
"suwit.tutorial": "WATCH THE TELL. SOME FISH LIE.",
"suwit.keys": "{rock} ROCK    {scissors} SCISSORS    {paper} PAPER    {charm} CHARM",
"result.detail.win": "{fish} ADDED TO BUCKET",
"story.story_prologue_zero.01": "BANK BALANCE: Rp 18,430",
"story.story_prologue_zero.02": "TOTAL DEBT: Rp 1,800,000",
"story.story_prologue_zero.03": "CEPATCASH — PAYMENT REMINDER",
"story.story_prologue_zero.04": "Your outstanding balance remains outstanding.\nWe are also outstandingly disappointed.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.05": "...Fair.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.06": "I'm leaving.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.07": "Yeah.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.08": "Did you open it again?",
"story.story_prologue_zero.09": "No.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.10": "I deleted everything.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.11": "Good.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.12": "Deleting it is the easy part.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.13": "I know.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.14": "There's rice in the cooker.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.15": "Okay.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.16": "And don't sell the cooker.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.17": "That happened once.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.18": "That is why I said it.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.19": "All right.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.20": "No shortcuts.",
"story.story_prologue_zero.21": "MANCING MANIA: GELUT EDITION",
"story.story_prologue_zero.22": "SUNDAY — 3:17 PM",
"story.story_first_fish.01": "Put me down.",
"story.story_first_fish.02": "...What?",
"story.story_first_fish.03": "You heard me.",
"story.story_first_fish.04": "Fish don't talk.",
"story.story_first_fish.05": "And unemployed men don't usually argue with dinner.",
"story.story_first_fish.06": "That felt unnecessary.",
"story.story_first_fish.07": "Square up.",
"story.story_first_market.01": "Fish fresh?",
"story.story_first_market.02": "Very.",
"story.story_first_market.03": "Still moving?",
"story.story_first_market.04": "Emotionally, yes.",
"story.story_first_market.05": "Put it on the scale.",
"story.story_first_market.06": "That's more than I expected.",
"story.story_first_market.07": "Then expect less. It's healthier.",
"story.story_first_market.08": "One down.",
"story.story_first_market.09": "One million seven hundred ninety thousand to go.",
"story.story_first_market.10": "...You didn't have to say the whole number.",
"story.story_first_market.11": "You looked too relaxed.",
"story.story_debt_100k.01": "PAID: Rp 100,000",
"story.story_debt_100k.02": "One hundred thousand.",
"story.story_debt_100k.03": "That's a number.",
"story.story_debt_100k.04": "It's a decent number.",
"story.story_debt_100k.05": "It's smaller than one point eight million.",
"story.story_debt_100k.06": "I liked it better before you helped.",
"story.story_debt_100k.07": "I wasn't helping.",
"story.story_debt_100k.08": "How was the lake?",
"story.story_debt_100k.09": "story.story_debt_100k.08",
"story.story_debt_100k.10": "Profitable enough to go back.",
"story.story_debt_100k.11": "story.story_debt_100k.10",
"story.story_debt_100k.12": "Go back to the lake or go back home?",
"story.story_debt_100k.13": "story.story_debt_100k.12",
"story.story_debt_100k.14": "Both.",
"story.story_debt_100k.15": "story.story_debt_100k.14",
"story.story_debt_100k.16": "Good answer.",
"story.story_debt_100k.17": "story.story_debt_100k.16",
"story.story_debt_300k.01": "I saw the payment.",
"story.story_debt_300k.02": "story.story_debt_300k.01",
"story.story_debt_300k.03": "Good payment or bad payment?",
"story.story_debt_300k.04": "story.story_debt_300k.03",
"story.story_debt_300k.05": "Payments are generally good, Darto.",
"story.story_debt_300k.06": "story.story_debt_300k.05",
"story.story_debt_300k.07": "Just checking the category.",
"story.story_debt_300k.08": "story.story_debt_300k.07",
"story.story_debt_300k.09": "Keep going.",
"story.story_debt_300k.10": "story.story_debt_300k.09",
"story.story_debt_600k.01": "Dad?",
"story.story_debt_600k.02": "Hey. Everything okay?",
"story.story_debt_600k.03": "Mom said you're fishing now.",
"story.story_debt_600k.04": "That's one way to describe it.",
"story.story_debt_600k.05": "What's the other way?",
"story.story_debt_600k.06": "Employment with unusually aggressive seafood.",
"story.story_debt_600k.07": "Mom said the fish fight you.",
"story.story_debt_600k.08": "Your mother shares too much.",
"story.story_debt_600k.09": "Did you win?",
"story.story_debt_600k.10": "Some of them.",
"story.story_debt_600k.11": "Which one's the weirdest?",
"story.story_debt_600k.12": "There's a tilapia that judges my exercise routine.",
"story.story_debt_600k.13": "Take notes.",
"story.story_debt_600k.14": "On the insults?",
"story.story_debt_600k.15": "On all of them.",
"story.story_debt_600k.16": "And send me a picture if you catch the golden one.",
"story.story_debt_600k.17": "You know about that one?",
"story.story_debt_600k.18": "The internet exists, Dad.",
"story.story_debt_600k.19": "Right. Boarding school has advanced technology.",
"story.story_debt_600k.20": "Very advanced. We have chairs.",
"story.story_debt_600k.21": "Show-off.",
"story.story_debt_600k.22": "FISH BOOK UNLOCKED",
"story.story_debt_600k.23": "Keep notes for Nisa. And, apparently, for science.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.01": "You're past halfway.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.02": "I noticed.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.03": "You usually avoid looking at numbers.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.04": "I'm trying a new hobby.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.05": "Numbers?",
"story.story_debt_1000k.06": "Finishing things.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.07": "When this is done...",
"story.story_debt_1000k.08": "The roof still leaks near the kitchen.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.09": "Romantic.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.10": "I'm serious.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.11": "I know.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.12": "I'm talking about after, Darto.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.13": "Yeah.",
"story.story_debt_1000k.14": "After sounds good.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.01": "That restaurant man asked about your fish again.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.02": "The one with the white van?",
"story.story_debt_1400k.03": "Yes.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.04": "Is that good?",
"story.story_debt_1400k.05": "He pays.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.06": "Excellent character reference.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.07": "He wants regular supply if you keep bringing decent fish.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.08": "Regular?",
"story.story_debt_1400k.09": "That's what I said.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.10": "Like... work?",
"story.story_debt_1400k.11": "Don't make it dramatic. Bring fish.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.12": "Right.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.13": "Fresh fish.",
"story.story_debt_1400k.14": "Emotionally?",
"story.story_debt_1400k.15": "No.",
"story.story_debt_1650k.01": "DEBT REMAINING: Rp 150,000",
"story.story_debt_1650k.02": "Almost.",
"story.story_debt_1650k.03": "Still looks like the same lake.",
"story.story_debt_1650k.04": "Good.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.01": "Enjoy your victory.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.02": "I was planning to.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.03": "The lake remembers.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.04": "That's fine.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.05": "Does the lake pay three hundred thousand?",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.06": "You disgust me.",
"story.story_arowana_first_win.07": "That's not a no.",
"story.story_debt_paid.01": "DEBT REMAINING: Rp 0",
"story.story_debt_paid.02": "CEPATCASH",
"story.story_debt_paid.03": "YOUR BALANCE HAS BEEN FULLY SETTLED.",
"story.story_debt_paid.04": "CEPATCASH",
"story.story_debt_paid.05": "Thank you.",
"story.story_debt_paid.06": "...That's it?",
"story.story_debt_paid.07": "No final boss?",
"story.story_debt_paid.08": "Good.",
"story.story_debt_paid.09": "I saw it.",
"story.story_debt_paid.10": "story.story_debt_paid.09",
"story.story_debt_paid.11": "It's done.",
"story.story_debt_paid.12": "story.story_debt_paid.11",
"story.story_debt_paid.13": "Come home when you're finished there.",
"story.story_debt_paid.14": "story.story_debt_paid.13",
"story.story_debt_paid.15": "Soon.",
"story.story_debt_paid.16": "story.story_debt_paid.15",
"story.story_debt_paid.17": "Okay.",
"story.story_debt_paid.18": "story.story_debt_paid.17",
"story.story_final_family.01": "So which one punched you?",
"story.story_final_family.02": "The catfish.",
"story.story_final_family.03": "He lost twice.",
"story.story_final_family.04": "Why are we keeping statistics?",
"story.story_final_family.05": "For science.",
"story.story_final_family.06": "Science has become very judgmental.",
"story.story_final_family.07": "You wrote that the tilapia called your posture weak.",
"story.story_final_family.08": "Accurate notes are important.",
"story.story_final_family.09": "Your posture is weak.",
"story.story_final_family.10": "This family has chosen violence.",
"story.story_final_family.11": "Are you still going to come here?",
"story.story_final_family.12": "Probably.",
"story.story_final_family.13": "He likes being yelled at by fish.",
"story.story_final_family.14": "I like the quiet parts.",
"story.story_final_family.15": "And the money.",
"story.story_final_family.16": "And some of the money.",
"story.story_final_family.17": "Don't start a fight.",
"story.story_final_family.18": "I don't start them.",
"story.story_final_family.19": "LIAR.",
"story.story_postgame_unlock.01": "FREE FISHING MODE UNLOCKED",
"story.story_postgame_unlock.02": "The debt is gone.\nThe fish are unfortunately still here.",
"story.story_postgame_unlock.03": "DEBT LEDGER has become FAMILY SAVINGS.",
"story.story_postgame_unlock.04": "Keep fishing, finish the Fish Book, upgrade your gear, chase records, or simply stay by the lake for a while.",
"story.story_postgame_unlock.05": "BACK TO THE LAKE",
"credits.01": "MANCING MANIA: GELUT EDITION",
"credits.02": "A very serious game about very unserious fish.",
